<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/11/eng@/~cl_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of “public service vehicle” the following definition: ‘ “p-hailing vehicle” means a motor vehicle used for the carriage of goods on any journey in consideration of a charge for each of the goods, in which the arrangement, booking or transaction, and the charge for such journey are facilitated through an electronic mobile application provided by an intermediation business;’; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/11/eng@> .
