<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/11/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 14 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (6) the following subsection: “(7) For the purpose of this Act, a p-hailing vehicle shall be a goods vehicle and subject to an intermediation business licence issued under Part IVa.”. Amendment of section 21a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/11/eng@> .
